 to help run the store</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorations wall/floor to customize your shop</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming to supply your shelves and reduce costs</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Production machines that process ingredients into new products</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing to bring in extra goods and variety</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Run your own grocery store. Stock shelves, scan items at the checkout, and keep the store moving — solo or with friends. Farm, process, and fish for goods to expand what you can sell.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/2fb7ab813f8165f8baab7bda3e9853dfc1b41427/header.jpg?t=1787792093", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/c077a8af661a00a4f6961a65390312686df13b5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787792093", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859130/c077a8af661a00a4f6961a65390312686df13b5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787792093", "website": "https://www.kappa-bits.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-4130 or AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 750 Ti or AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "legal_notice": "© 2025 Kappabits. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Kappa Bits Games"], "publishers": ["Kappa Bits Games"], "package_groups": [], "platfor